Accessories gives boost to Willpower and Agility for the player's burglar Cats in The Burgle Cats. They can be obtained from Accessories Chests and from the [[The Burgle Cats/Shop|Market]]'s daily deals. Some accessories has additional Premium skin with an extra passive effect in battles.

