==Trivia==
*The Master's Wig resembles Goku's haircut from ''[[wikipedia:Dragon Ball|Dragon Ball]]''.
*The Hip Headband is a reference to Bakabon's Papa's iconic look from [[wikipedia:Tensai Bakabon|''Tensai Bakabon'']], which is proven by how it's meant to pair with [[The Burgle Cats/Outfits|Dad's Belly-band]]. Its description sarcastically alludes to his stupidity.
*The Cool Red Cap, which is "not suitable for plumbers", is an obvious reference to the titular character of the ''[[wikipedia:Mario (franchise)|Mario]]'' franchise.
*The "famous actress" in the Glamorous Wig's description is presumably [[wikipedia:Marilyn Monroe|Marilyn Monroe]].
